{"id":"u-4f8789a1-814f-4802-b8c3-c9d7305dd26c","src":"community","title":"BLS Meta Hybrid Program","author":"Alexis Martínez","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/McfuYN-bls-meta-hybrid-program","desc":"This is the BLS Meta Hybrid Program – an 8-week training system built for experienced lifters who want to stay strong without losing their engine.\n\nIt combines Mike Matthews' Bigger Leaner Stronger double-progression (4-6, 6-8, 8-10 rep ranges) with real hybrid conditioning. You’ll train 4 days of heavy compounds at RPE 7-8 – bench, squat, deadlift, press – and finish with 3 targeted runs: short hill sprints, strides and easy Zone 2.\n\nEvery lift uses RPE, not fixed percentages, so you auto-regulate after a layoff or a minor low-back tweak. Progression is simple: hit the top of the rep range on all sets, add 5lbs next week. Accessory work and core are programmed to protect the lumbar spine (no grinding, lots of anti-rotation and supported rows).\n\nPerfect for intermediate to advanced athletes coming back from injury, or anyone chasing a 225+ bench and a sub-25 5K in the same block. Strength first, conditioning second, no fluff.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":40,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-12T13:37:28.230Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest Day+ Hills","Back Day","Leg Day","Shoulders & arms"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Calentamiento específico: barra x10, 135x5, 185x3, 205x1\nPeso: 225 lbs"},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Peso: 165 lbs"},{"n":"Seated Dip (Machine)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Peso: 320 lbs"},{"n":"Cable Crossover","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Peso: Moderado"},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"Peso: 120 lbs"},{"n":"Pallof Press","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dead Bug","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"